<title>USA: Riverside Cty, Calif., deal ylds 4.85 pct in 2009.</title>
<headline>Riverside Cty, Calif., deal ylds 4.85 pct in 2009.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced $64.6 million Riverside County Transportation Commission, Calif., bonds at a top yield of 4.85 percent in 2009.</p>
<p>The firm has since said it repriced the issue, raising the par amount to $74 million and lowering yields in several maturities. The repricing will follow in a separate story.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
